## Purpose

The owner asks for the cursor/background interaction from the earlier prototype.
Its saved source appends the cursor to the ambient primitives and renders both
with a smooth-union distance field. This is soft joining and pulling apart,
not simulated pushing or permanent movement of background anchors.

