## Acceptance criteria

- Approaching shapes form a soft neck, merge and separate naturally on withdrawal.
- Cursor movement does not move the large groups into the center column.
- No oversized ambient overlay is lifted above reading text or notebook paper.
- Far-away and inactive-cursor rendering retain the existing scene.
- Background2Xsizes, unchanged living head, longer trail and newest8spawns remain.
- Evidence distinguishes synthetic GPU tests, actual page compositing and live deployment.

